.TH grokbot-tui 1  "grokbot-tui 1.41.5" 
.SH NAME
grokbot\-tui \- Terminal UI for Grok Bot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgrokbot\-tui\fR [\fB\-\-mock\fR] [\fB\-\-account\fR] [\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\fR] [\fB\-\-list\-themes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Terminal UI for Grok Bot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-mock\fR
Use the offline mock API (fake bots, echo replies; any token except "bad" works)
.TP
\fB\-\-account\fR \fI<ALIAS>\fR
Account alias to start in (default: last active account)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBGROKBOT_TUI_ACCOUNT\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Data directory holding context.db (default ~/.grokbot\-tui; a pre\-1.2 ~/.gb is moved there)
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Use this theme (a file in <data dir>/themes, without .toml) for this run only; the ui.theme pref, F5 or /theme use set it for good
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-themes\fR
List the themes in <data dir>/themes (● marks the one in use; broken files say why) and exit
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
grokbot\-tui\-mcp(1)
MCP server for other agents (Claude Code, Cursor, ...): `mcp serve [\-\-stdio|\-\-http [ADDR]]`, `mcp token`, `mcp config`
.TP
grokbot\-tui\-completions(1)
Print a shell completion script to stdout: bash, zsh, fish, powershell or elvish (e.g. `source <(grokbot\-tui completions bash)`)
.SH VERSION
v1.41.5
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_TOKEN\fR
Gateway token override for the startup account (never saved).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_GATEWAY_URL\fR
Gateway URL for that token (else the stored URL).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_GATEWAY_HEADERS\fR
JSON object of extra gateway headers.
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_CURSOR_API_BASE_URL\fR
Cursor backend for the EnsureSandBox exchange (must be *.cursor.sh / *.cursor.com).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_CURSOR_CLIENT_VERSION\fR
x\-cursor\-client\-version (env > pref cursor.client_version > detected app > 0.70.2).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_CURSOR_CLIENT_TYPE\fR
x\-cursor\-client\-type (default sand).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_SAND_BOX_NAMESPACE\fR
x\-sand\-box\-namespace (default prod).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_ACCOUNT\fR
Starting account alias (same as \-\-account).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_ALLOW_LOCAL_GATEWAY\fR
Set to 1 to allow http(s) loopback gateways (development).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_APP_DIR\fR
Grok Bot desktop install dir, for version detection.
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_MAX_RESPONSE_BYTES\fR
Cap on one gateway response body in bytes (default 64 MiB).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_NO_THEME_DOWNLOAD\fR
Set to 1 to never download the default theme.
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_THEME_URL\fR
Download themes from here instead of the release tag (<url><name>.toml).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_NO_HYPERLINKS\fR
Set (to anything) to turn off OSC 8 hyperlinks.
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_FORCE_SSH\fR
0 or 1: override SSH detection (links use the built\-in browser over SSH).
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_FUZZBALL\fR
off: skip the Fuzzball capability query at startup.
.TP
\fBGROKBOT_TUI_IMAGES\fR
halfblocks: skip the terminal graphics query and draw images with half blocks.
.PP
Every older GB_* name (e.g. GB_GROKBOT_TOKEN) still works when its GROKBOT_TUI_* name is not set.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.grokbot\-tui/context.db\fR
Accounts, logins, chats, prompt history, preferences and the search index (override the directory with \fB\-\-data\-dir\fR).
.TP
\fI<data dir>/themes/\fR
Theme files (see \fB\-\-list\-themes\fR).
.SH SEE ALSO
In\-app help: F1 or /help. Docs: https://weirdbrains.github.io/grokbot\-tui/docs/
